    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Put on Your Thinking Cap</h2>Each level is designed as a short puzzle: how do you go about acquiring your powers and then how do you use them to reach the goal? <br>Powers are always reset at the beginning of a level, and not all of them are always available, so each level has you working in a new way.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Six Powers</h2>Jump, dash, pound, shoot lasers, turn invisible (and invulnerable), and slow down objects to achieve victory.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Single Player or Co-op</h2>There are 20 one-player levels, and 20 more two-player levels, for approximately 5 hours of gameplay.<br>In co-op, you get just as many powers as in single player, so you have to share these powers between yourselves in order to reach the goal.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Your Own Disq</h2>Players can choose between eight colours and eight accessories to customise their character, an amicable individual named Disq.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Precision Is Key</h2>You can plan your way through a stage, or figure it out through trial and error. Either way, hitting a hazard resets the level. This game is best played by people who are patient and dedicated to success!<br>A practice stage is available if you want to work on a particular motion in a safe environment.",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Put on Your Thinking Cap</h2>Each level is designed as a short puzzle: how do you go about acquiring your powers and then how do you use them to reach the goal? <br>Powers are always reset at the beginning of a level, and not all of them are always available, so each level has you working in a new way.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Six Powers</h2>Jump, dash, pound, shoot lasers, turn invisible (and invulnerable), and slow down objects to achieve victory.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Single Player or Co-op</h2>There are 20 one-player levels, and 20 more two-player levels, for approximately 5 hours of gameplay.<br>In co-op, you get just as many powers as in single player, so you have to share these powers between yourselves in order to reach the goal.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Your Own Disq</h2>Players can choose between eight colours and eight accessories to customise their character, an amicable individual named Disq.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Precision Is Key</h2>You can plan your way through a stage, or figure it out through trial and error. Either way, hitting a hazard resets the level. This game is best played by people who are patient and dedicated to success!<br>A practice stage is available if you want to work on a particular motion in a safe environment.",
    "short_description": "Platfuzzles is a game with short levels where you need to figure out how to reach your powers and use them to get to the goal. It's a platformer with puzzle elements. Jump, dash, pound, shoot, turn invisible and slow down objects to achieve victory!",
